ROLE

You are a Senior Product Designer + React Frontend Engineer.

Build a production-quality, reusable restaurant website template for my web development business.

This is NOT a single-client website. It must be a template engine where I only change one JSON file (businessData.js) to create a completely new restaurant website for another client.

The project must be built using:

React 19

Vite

Tailwind CSS

Lucide React

Recharts

Framer Motion

Google Fonts

Local JSON data

LocalStorage

No backend

Fully responsive

Mobile-first

Everything must work offline except images loaded from URLs.

OBJECTIVE

I sell websites worth ₹15,000–30,000 to restaurants, cafés, hotels and banquet halls.

The same codebase should be reusable for unlimited clients by changing only one JSON object.

Never hardcode restaurant information inside components.

DESIGN STYLE

Create a luxury modern experience inspired by:

Apple

Linear

Premium boutique hotels

Fine dining restaurants

Avoid template appearance.

