MOST IMPORTANT FILE

Create one file:

businessData.js

Every client information must come from here.

Structure:

export const business = {

  name:"Mayur's Fine Dine",

  tagline:"Luxury Multi Cuisine Restaurant",

  whatsapp:"919936329494",

  phone:"+91 99363 29494",

