INSTALL DEPENDENCIES

Use:

npm install lucide-react recharts framer-motion
CODING RULES

Never hardcode business data.

Every text comes from JSON where appropriate.

Components must be reusable.

Clean naming.

No emojis.

Premium UI only.

Use Lucide icons exclusively.

Fully commented code.

Production-ready quality.

FINAL OUTPUT

Generate the entire React Vite project, not snippets.

The website should be convincing enough that a restaurant owner believes it is worth ₹30,000 and I should be able to create a new client website by editing only src/data/businessData.js.